[?2004l[?2004h>     Optimized version of the reference model.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>     Reference: x -> Linear(x) -> clone -> *scaling -> +original
[?2004l[?2004h>     Mathematically: out = (1 + scaling) * (x @ W^T + b)
[?2004l[?2004h>     We fold the scale into precomputed weights/bias, so the forward is a
